    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, people say that... but it feels like talking to a wall. it's not just being sad. it's like the very concept of tomorrow feels like a chore. just another day of dragging myself through all this sludge. it's making me think that maybe the exhaustion is just... permanent. like there's no version of life where i'm not this hollow.",
